{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048020/extras/256f8f59bfdf2a11d7f91a6a57533b53.webp?t=1766542001\" width=1560 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Are you craving the movie theater experience? (<i>Yes!</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Do you wanna watch timeless classics? (<i>Yes!</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Can you be bothered to leave home? <i>(No!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then boot up this game and choose from a selection of <strong>17 popular public domain movies</strong>, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror</strong>\u00a0films like <i>Night of the Living Dead</i> and <i>Carnival of Souls</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comedy</strong>\u00a0films from the <i>Marx Brothers</i> and <i>Laurel &amp; Hardy</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crime/Noir</strong> films like <i>Kansas City Confidential</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fantasy</strong> movies like\u00a0<i>Gulliver's Travels (1939) </i>and <i>Jungle Book (1942)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic, cheesy B-movies like <i>Plan 9 from Outer Space</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more! (+ more to be added in future updates)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048020/extras/c901e2f7d0544a780fce3902d105e353.webp?t=1766542001\" width=1560 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hang out in the lobby and get some snacks, then head on over to an auditorium and choose a movie. You have the whole place to yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048020/extras/f7a514aa009c7ff84f531c8d56c718c3.avif?t=1766542001\" width=366 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048020/extras/256f8f59bfdf2a11d7f91a6a57533b53.webp?t=1766542001\" width=1560 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Useful features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can <strong>pause</strong> the movie and pick up where you left off later</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can turn on <strong>captions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can watch in <strong>full-screen</strong> mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can <strong>rewind</strong> and <strong>fast-forward</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048020/extras/c901e2f7d0544a780fce3902d105e353.webp?t=1766542001\" width=1560 height=63 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048020?t=1766542001","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048020?t=1766542001","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048020/1ffad137ed87e042d814f47ed78d3dbfd6de4f4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766542001","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048020/1ffad137ed87e042d814f47ed78d3dbfd6de4f4f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766542001","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"descripti